        <mxCell id="recovery" value="&lt;b&gt;Recovery requirement — not an implemented runtime flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read → process / verified durable handoff → XACK. Interrupted work remains pending; eligible recovery must be idempotent.&lt;br&gt;Retry / dead-letter policy TBD. Duplicate or late events must not silently corrupt call state. Delivery failure ownership remains OPEN." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;fontColor=#002663;fillColor=#EAF4FF;strokeColor=#B7C9D3;spacing=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1" sourceRefs="" componentId="recovery" decisionStatus="NOTATION" deploymentStatus="NOT VERIFIED">
